OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after tiger attack at
OL,4,Awildlife park
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Wildlife Park will remain
OL,7,Fclosed on Sunday following the incident
OL,8,Fand said in a statement: "Our thoughts
OL,9,Fand heartfelt sympathies are with the
OL,10,Ffamily and loved ones of the person who
OL,11,Fhas lost their life."
